	"AI that can do almost any mental task a person can. Crossing it is a milestone every faction watches.": "Une IA capable de presque toute tâche intellectuelle humaine. La franchir est un jalon que toutes les factions surveillent.",
	"ASI (artificial superintelligence)": "ASI (superintelligence artificielle)",
